{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10282280","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1028228001:1":{"text":"フラベル先生、すみませんでした。勝手に学園を抜け出して……ですが……","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔老师，对不起，我不该偷偷溜出学院。但是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD340885CEB19011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028228002:0":{"text":"大丈夫ですよ。話はロンロンから聞きました。神から与えられた才能を発見するためだったのですよね？","source_cn":"没关系，我听满满说了，你是为了寻找天赋，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD0D0C8DB52E058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028228003:1":{"text":"はい。ですがあれこれ試して、結局見つけることができませんでした……","source_cn":"嗯，可找了这么大一圈，还是什么都没找到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDF7C400D24F36B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028228004:1":{"text":"ランディ、私もあなたと同じように、風の言葉も分からなければ、剣術の才能もありません。私も子どもの頃、自分の才能が見い出せず、あれこれと悩んでいたことがあります。","source_cn":"兰迪，我和你一样，既不懂风语也不会剑术。小的时候，我也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51C2CFEBADC12BE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028228005:1":{"text":"それで……見つかったのですか？","source_cn":"那……你找到了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C9E86B6DD390EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028228006:0":{"text":"ええ。時間はかかったけど、見つけることができました。私が天から与えられた力とは、あなたのような子供たちと一緒に過ごし、その子たちの世話をし、そして導くことです。","source_cn":"嗯，虽然花了不少时间，但还是找到了，我的天赋——就是和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568309B39EB73E41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028228007:0":{"text":"ごらんなさい。ミサタ様はこの森に無限の可能性を授けてくださいました。故に万物は生き生きと輝いているのです。あなたはまだたった三回試しただけ。焦る必要はありません。まだまだ可能性はあります。","source_cn":"你看，弥萨忒赋予这片森林无限的可能，所以万物各有芬芳。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E40AD213849893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028228008:1":{"text":"でも、もし風語りや茨の護衛隊、それからヴィジランツに入れるような力がなかったら、ボクはみんなのために何ができるのでしょう？","source_cn":"可是，如果没有足够的天赋加入风语者、荆棘卫队或巡游队，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE8F4663399BC77F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028228009:0":{"text":"植物学者、シェフ、建築士……もしくは想像力豊かな小説家なんかはどうですか？","source_cn":"成为一名植物学者、厨师、建筑师……或者是充满想象力的作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F34A5D4AA6E4B2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028228010:0":{"text":"森の中に咲き乱れる花や、そこに根付く草木は、その一つ一つが違っていて、同じ物は二つと存在しません。だからこそ森はあんなにも美しいのです。","source_cn":"丛林中盛开着所有的花，生长着不同的树木，正是这些不同，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA15